1.	John Nichol, $50; K. McKay, $50; Wm. MacLean, $30; Freeman Hagar, $50; R. E. Hagar, $30; Chas. Towner, $25; John J. Ryer, $40; H. Smith (resigned, October 13), $40; B. O. Bower, $40; Oliver Goodick, $40;
S.	Smith, $40; John McKay,. $40; R. Firth, $40; J. F. Farrington, $258; Geo. Long-hurst, $404.25; H. C. Dash, $156.60; J. E. Gross, $122.40; W. E. Decker, $25; D. P. Swim, $25; F. Poole, $25; V. Brannen, $462; H. L. Shand, $462; B. H. Smith, $462; David Atwood, $412.50; J. E. Smith, $390; John Nickerson, $255; H. Swaine, $152; P. A. Stoddart, 647.50; Judah Nickerson, $384;
J.	M. Davis, $50; total, $3,677.
2.	John Nichol, R. M. McKay, Wm. McLean, Freeman Hagar, Robert E. Hagar, Chas.. Towner, John J. Ryer, Clifford Harris (in place H. Smith); B. O. Bower, Oliver Goodick, S. Smith, John McKay, R. Firth, J. F. Farrington, Geo. Longhurst, H.
C.	Dash, J. E. Gross, W. E. Decker, D. P. Swim, F. Poole, V. Brannen, H. L. Shand, B. H. Smith, David Atwood, Jos. W. V. Wilson, (in place of J. E. Smith, deceased); Jos. Nickerson, (in place of John Nickerson); George Nickerson, (in place of Joseph Nickerson); H. Swaine, P. A. Stoddart, Judah Nickerson, J. M. Davis.
